    "concept_model": "banana_pro",
    "prompt": "Stylized low-poly 3D game asset with a clean, readable silhouette and slightly exaggerated proportions. Flat color blocking with minimal fine surface detail, matte hand-painted albedo-only texture, restricted muted palette. No photorealism, no glossy PBR shine, no pixel art. Flat, even, shadowless lighting from all sides on a plain, uniform mid-grey background. Every surface shows its true base color at the same brightness, front and back, with no cast shadows and no highlights. A single short recurve bow standing upright, seen from the front, as an isolated prop. Two warm mid-brown limbs curl strongly outward at each tip and end in small pale yellowed beige caps; the grip in the middle is wrapped in vivid scarlet red cloth, and one thin straight string runs from tip to tip.",
